{"unit_id":"csukingzq__dsh-pdf-translator#card-zh","repo":"csukingzq/dsh-pdf-translator","commit":"fec793803436351f550a7c48a682cd796340506a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pdf-translator 是面向 DSH 网页与桌面客户端的 PDF 翻译插件，通过桌面面板和聊天工具调用处理本地 PDF。它先识别文档结构，再调用支持图片输入的模型翻译正文，并用 LaTeX 重排输出中文 PDF 和可编辑源码压缩包。用户可以选择页码、设置输出目录、查看任务进度、复用缓存，并按需开启 AI 核验和修订。适合需要将论文或其他 PDF 转成中文并继续编辑排版的 DSH 用户。使用前需准备 Python、Pandoc、Tectonic，并配置模型接口、模型名称和 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:34-57","src/client.jsx:118-126","work/cli.py:88-99"]}
{"unit_id":"csukingzq__dsh-pdf-translator#card-en","repo":"csukingzq/dsh-pdf-translator","commit":"fec793803436351f550a7c48a682cd796340506a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pdf-translator translates PDFs in DSH. It analyzes structure, sends page images to a vision model, and uses LaTeX to create Chinese PDFs and editable source archives. Users select pages, track progress, reuse caches, and review results. Python, Pandoc, Tectonic, and a vision API key are needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:34-57","src/client.jsx:118-126","work/cli.py:88-99"]}
